Rahul and Arjun wanted to get to know each other. They realized that the sum of their ages is 20. What will be the sum of their ages in 10 years?,Mico and Marco wanted to get to know each other. They realized that the sum of their ages is 20. What will be the sum of their ages in 10 years?,40,40,40,40,"1) Let Rahul’s current age be R and Arjun’s current age be A.
