"Karim is 10 years older than his younger sister, Fatima. Fatima, on the other hand, is 4 years younger than her boyfriend, Youssef. If Youssef is 24 years old, how old is Karim?","Jeff is 10 years older than his younger sister, Martha. Martha, on the other hand, is 4 years younger than her boyfriend, Mike. If Mike is 24 years old, how old is Jeff?",30,30,30,30,"Let Youssef’s age be Y = 24.

