Ivan goes to the market to buy some coffee. The usual brand of coffee he buys costs 5 rubles per kilogram. He had to buy a more expensive brand that cost 20% more since his favorite brand was sold out. He decides to buy a week's worth of coffee and he uses 1 kilogram of coffee per day. He also decided to buy himself a pirozhok for 2 rubles. How much did everything cost?,Roger goes to the store to buy some coffee. The normal brand of coffee he buys cost $5 per pound. He had to buy a more expensive brand that cost 20% more since his favorite brand was sold out. He decides to buy a week's worth of coffee and he uses 1 pound of coffee per day. He also decided to buy himself a donut for $2. How much did everything cost?,44,44,44,44,"Step 1: Determine the price of the more expensive coffee.
