- 20 ten-poisha coins = 20 × 10 = 200 poisha
- 40 taka notes = 40 × 100 = 4000 poisha

Total in poisha = 100 + 200 + 200 + 4000 = 4500 poisha

Convert to taka: 4500 poisha ÷ 100 = 45 taka

