Leilani invested 300 vatu into a scheme that accumulates simple interest at the rate of three-quarters of the original amount per year. How much in total will she have after 3 years?,Brenda invested $300 into a scheme that accumulates simple interest at the rate of three-quarters of the original amount per year. How much in total will she have after 3 years?,975,975,975,975,"Step 1: Identify principal (P), rate (r), and time (t).
- Principal P = 300 vatu
- Rate r = three-quarters of the original amount per year = 75% = 0.75 per year
- Time t = 3 years

Step 2: Compute simple interest.
- Simple interest I = P × r × t = 300 × 0.75 × 3
- 300 × 0.75 = 225
- 225 × 3 = 675

Step 3: Compute total amount.
- Total A = P + I = 300 + 675 = 975

#### 975",,"Step 1: Identify principal (P), rate (r), and time (t).
- Principal P = 300 vatu
- Rate r = three-quarters of the original amount per year = 75% = 0.75 per year
- Time t = 3 years
