A trompo spins at five times the speed of a chunche. A brete spins eleven times faster than a chunche. A brete spins at 121 meters per second. How fast does a trompo spin?,A whirligig spins at five times the speed of a thingamabob. A whatchamacallit spins eleven times faster than a thingamabob. A whatchamacallit spins at 121 meters per second. How fast does a whirligig spin?,55,55,55,55,"Let c be the speed of a chunche (m/s).

- A trompo spins at five times the speed of a chunche: trompo = 5c.
- A brete spins eleven times faster than a chunche: brete = 11c.
- Given: brete = 121 m/s.

So, 11c = 121 ⇒ c = 121 / 11 = 11 m/s.

Trompo speed = 5c = 5 × 11 = 55 m/s.

#### 55",,"Let c be the speed of a chunche (m/s).
