- Makeup sets: 3 sets × 6 colors = 18 colors
- Total initially = 8 + 18 = 26 colors

Events:
1) Sister steals one palette:
- One palette = 4 colors
- New total = 26 − 4 = 22 colors

2) Bilung uses up half of the colors from one makeup set:
- One makeup set has 6 colors; half used up = 3 colors
- New total = 22 − 3 = 19 colors

